(7132390, 1092351, 114285, '<td valign="top">excellent, but you didn''t need the foreground kind of spoils the comp, and I would of gone for a letter box style frame. 8</td>', 'excellent, but you didn''t need the foreground kind of spoils the comp, and I would of gone for a letter box style frame. 8', '2013-11-20 00:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132392, 1092427, 114285, '<td valign="top">stunning!</td>', 'stunning!', '2013-11-20 00:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132626, 1091534, 16148, '<td valign="top">Sensitively judged and a very touching image.  My top pick.</td>', 'Sensitively judged and a very touching image.  My top pick.', '2013-11-20 10:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132690, 1092424, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the blurred #10 domino to show movement, and the contrast of the crystal clear lines and dots on domino #11. The gap between #7 and #8 creates tension. Fantastic movement across the image. It draws my eye right where you want me to look!</td>', 'I love the blurred #10 domino to show movement, and the contrast of the crystal clear lines and dots on domino #11. The gap between #7 and #8 creates tension. Fantastic movement across the image. It draws my eye right where you want me to look!', '2013-11-20 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132691, 1092521, 22384, '<td valign="top">The blown out geese (?) tricked by eye into believing that they were flying backwards in an inverted "V". I love the composition of this image and the idea that the birds are flying to the left indicating the past. Summer is gone.Unique and creative. Well done!</td>', 'The blown out geese (?) tricked by eye into believing that they were flying backwards in an inverted "V". I love the composition of this image and the idea that the birds are flying to the left indicating the past. Summer is gone.Unique and creative. Well done!', '2013-11-20 13:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132694, 1092237, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fibonacci sequence,nice for all of us geeks. Shouldn''t it start with zero, or am I wrong. Then you could have ended with 55 which would have represented ll nicely.</td>', 'Fibonacci sequence,nice for all of us geeks. Shouldn''t it start with zero, or am I wrong. Then you could have ended with 55 which would have represented ll nicely.', '2013-11-20 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132696, 1092295, 22384, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting. Fun image. Oddly enough, I wanted the adult to be looking at the child, instead of down and away.</td>', 'Love the lighting. Fun image. Oddly enough, I wanted the adult to be looking at the child, instead of down and away.', '2013-11-20 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132697, 1092258, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great title, but I feel tension in this photo instead of a sense of kicking back and finding some peace. I would have liked to see the birds landing on the dock instead of taking off (but it is kinda'' hard to control 11 birds). Fun idea, but the vibrant green in the background distracts from the image for me.</td>', 'Great title, but I feel tension in this photo instead of a sense of kicking back and finding some peace. I would have liked to see the birds landing on the dock instead of taking off (but it is kinda'' hard to control 11 birds). Fun idea, but the vibrant green in the background distracts from the image for me.', '2013-11-20 13:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132698, 1092322, 22384, '<td valign="top">It took me a while, and then I saw it because I looked at the image before reading the title. Nice work with the value scale and, also, the muted colors to the vibrant color of the dress. I really like this piece. Wonderful sense of chaotic movement, and then the direction ordered by the crossing sign. Well done!</td>', 'It took me a while, and then I saw it because I looked at the image before reading the title. Nice work with the value scale and, also, the muted colors to the vibrant color of the dress. I really like this piece. Wonderful sense of chaotic movement, and then the direction ordered by the crossing sign. Well done!', '2013-11-20 13:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132700, 1092336, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. I am distracted by the scratches on the ruler. The movement across the frame is nice and interesting choice of color to make that "11" pop!</td>', 'Fun idea. I am distracted by the scratches on the ruler. The movement across the frame is nice and interesting choice of color to make that "11" pop!', '2013-11-20 13:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132701, 1092436, 22384, '<td valign="top">I can''t find a thing wrong with this. I absolutely love it! Nice movement through the frame, I love the bubbles within the bubbles. I can''t wait to read how you did it!</td>', 'I can''t find a thing wrong with this. I absolutely love it! Nice movement through the frame, I love the bubbles within the bubbles. I can''t wait to read how you did it!', '2013-11-20 13:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132702, 1092515, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I think something other than flowers would have been a better subject choice. I am having a hard time finding a comfortable focal point.</td>', 'Nice image, but I think something other than flowers would have been a better subject choice. I am having a hard time finding a comfortable focal point.', '2013-11-20 13:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132704, 1092310, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea! I love your use of the value scale to make those legs stand out. Very nice!</td>', 'Brilliant idea! I love your use of the value scale to make those legs stand out. Very nice!', '2013-11-20 13:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132706, 1091534, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image certainly evoked emotion in me. Creative and the sense of being a voyeur into the woman''s privacy creates an eerie image. It leaves me with a sense of sadness. Any image that evokes an emotion in me usually rates high in my book. The entire right side of the frame being blurred out makes me wonder if this woman has much of a future. Powerful and unique.</td>', 'This image certainly evoked emotion in me. Creative and the sense of being a voyeur into the woman''s privacy creates an eerie image. It leaves me with a sense of sadness. Any image that evokes an emotion in me usually rates high in my book. The entire right side of the frame being blurred out makes me wonder if this woman has much of a future. Powerful and unique.', '2013-11-20 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132707, 1092440, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the foreground. I am not such a big fan of the background. The title helps, but a piece should stand on its own. I think it is the smears in the upper right of the frame that distract me from your focal point of the leaf in the background. Very creative, though.</td>', 'I love the foreground. I am not such a big fan of the background. The title helps, but a piece should stand on its own. I think it is the smears in the upper right of the frame that distract me from your focal point of the leaf in the background. Very creative, though.', '2013-11-20 13:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132708, 1092399, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what to look at. This image is too soft for me.</td>', 'I am not sure what to look at. This image is too soft for me.', '2013-11-20 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132709, 1092391, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning angle, crispness and color. Lovely use of the frame, and even though everything is perfectly still and clear, I get a sense of the movement of time since it is a clock. Well done!</td>', 'Stunning angle, crispness and color. Lovely use of the frame, and even though everything is perfectly still and clear, I get a sense of the movement of time since it is a clock. Well done!', '2013-11-20 13:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132710, 1092347, 22384, '<td valign="top">Love the subject matter, the focal point. Stunning shot!</td>', 'Love the subject matter, the focal point. Stunning shot!', '2013-11-20 14:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132711, 1092351, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am having a hard time finding your subject. The green in the foreground distracts my eye from your true subject.</td>', 'I am having a hard time finding your subject. The green in the foreground distracts my eye from your true subject.', '2013-11-20 14:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132713, 1092470, 22384, '<td valign="top">I want to straighten that sign... It distracts from the challenge subject. I would have like to see the lights in the green light and number 11 be more crisp and the sign a bit out of focus. Great idea, though.</td>', 'I want to straighten that sign... It distracts from the challenge subject. I would have like to see the lights in the green light and number 11 be more crisp and the sign a bit out of focus. Great idea, though.', '2013-11-20 14:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132714, 1092425, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning. I love the way you filled the frame. Beautiful colors and nice contrast of textures. Well done!</td>', 'Simply stunning. I love the way you filled the frame. Beautiful colors and nice contrast of textures. Well done!', '2013-11-20 14:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132740, 1092427, 22384, '<td valign="top">There are many interesting elements in this photo - the trees, the movement of the power lines into the photo, but I need a focal point. All of the distractions take away from the purpose of the challenge. Maybe get closer to the cows, or shoot from a different angle.</td>', 'There are many interesting elements in this photo - the trees, the movement of the power lines into the photo, but I need a focal point. All of the distractions take away from the purpose of the challenge. Maybe get closer to the cows, or shoot from a different angle.', '2013-11-20 15:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132742, 1091942, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and great way to honor the soldier in your photo. I am going to bump up this score simply because the the subject matter. Creative and I like the photos within your photo.</td>', 'Great idea, and great way to honor the soldier in your photo. I am going to bump up this score simply because the the subject matter. Creative and I like the photos within your photo.', '2013-11-20 15:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132743, 1092339, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Great use of color. The movement within the frame is intense, nice capture. I like this piece.</td>', 'Stunning image. Great use of color. The movement within the frame is intense, nice capture. I like this piece.', '2013-11-20 15:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132744, 1092414, 22384, '<td valign="top">The movement of the fish and their shadows is interesting. There are just too many other things that distract from the main images.</td>', 'The movement of the fish and their shadows is interesting. There are just too many other things that distract from the main images.', '2013-11-20 15:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132746, 1092491, 22384, '<td valign="top">Trippy picture. The buildings in the background are so solid that they distract from the ghostlike images from your eleven exposures. At first I thought the "11" was the yellow lines because they stood out and drew my eye into the photograph. That might have been the more powerful image for this challenge.</td>', 'Trippy picture. The buildings in the background are so solid that they distract from the ghostlike images from your eleven exposures. At first I thought the "11" was the yellow lines because they stood out and drew my eye into the photograph. That might have been the more powerful image for this challenge.', '2013-11-20 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132747, 1092503, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color. I am looking for some symbolism in it, but, given the philosophy, the color is probably not symbolic.</td>', 'Interesting use of color. I am looking for some symbolism in it, but, given the philosophy, the color is probably not symbolic.', '2013-11-20 15:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132750, 1092525, 22384, '<td valign="top">Creative. Love the idea and recognized what you meant immediately without the title. Fun picture. I bumping the score up because it makes me happy to look at it. It isn''t overdone. I enjoy that it is a tad messy.</td>', 'Creative. Love the idea and recognized what you meant immediately without the title. Fun picture. I bumping the score up because it makes me happy to look at it. It isn''t overdone. I enjoy that it is a tad messy.', '2013-11-20 15:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132752, 1092502, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simple elegance. The grainy background distracts from the clean lines of your image. Nice placement of the the image within the frame.</td>', 'Simple elegance. The grainy background distracts from the clean lines of your image. Nice placement of the the image within the frame.', '2013-11-20 15:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132754, 1092528, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fun use of color. I would have backed it down a bit and made the 11 smaller. It overwhelms the eye, and I have a hard time deciding where to focus. Create idea, though.</td>', 'Fun use of color. I would have backed it down a bit and made the 11 smaller. It overwhelms the eye, and I have a hard time deciding where to focus. Create idea, though.', '2013-11-20 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132756, 1092402, 22384, '<td valign="top">Love the hand. The bright green at the top of the picture distracted me a bit. I do love the pink contrast of the hand with the green within it. The wrinkles on the index finger and thumb are wonderful. I really love that part of this picture. Nice image.</td>', 'Love the hand. The bright green at the top of the picture distracted me a bit. I do love the pink contrast of the hand with the green within it. The wrinkles on the index finger and thumb are wonderful. I really love that part of this picture. Nice image.', '2013-11-20 16:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132757, 1092303, 22384, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Intense. It reminds me of the doomsday clock. A minute hand in there to show movement of some sort would be menacing. I am interested in how this was lit, or how you edited it so cleanly. I guess it is advanced editing...</td>', 'Whoa! Intense. It reminds me of the doomsday clock. A minute hand in there to show movement of some sort would be menacing. I am interested in how this was lit, or how you edited it so cleanly. I guess it is advanced editing...', '2013-11-20 16:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132758, 1092523, 22384, '<td valign="top">Love the image, but am drawn to the woman in the right background. She seems more animated than your subjects. Creative idea!</td>', 'Love the image, but am drawn to the woman in the right background. She seems more animated than your subjects. Creative idea!', '2013-11-20 16:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132759, 1092497, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Love everything ab out it, even the title. It is so symbolic, given that you used decaying leaves. Nice!</td>', 'Stunning image. Love everything ab out it, even the title. It is so symbolic, given that you used decaying leaves. Nice!', '2013-11-20 16:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132772, 1092339, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the colours - Irene?</td>', 'Love the colours - Irene?', '2013-11-20 16:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132773, 1092515, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty! Robert?</td>', 'Pretty! Robert?', '2013-11-20 16:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132774, 1092049, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool collection.</td>', 'Cool collection.', '2013-11-20 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132777, 1092496, 22384, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and use of the value scale. Creative!</td>', 'Love the lighting and use of the value scale. Creative!', '2013-11-20 17:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132779, 1091675, 22384, '<td valign="top">Too many focal points for me. Lovely colors, though!</td>', 'Too many focal points for me. Lovely colors, though!', '2013-11-20 17:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132780, 1092512, 22384, '<td valign="top">I had grown a bit weary of flowers, but this is a nice shot. Great choice for background color with burned edges. I don''t know if the glow is lighting or editing, but it makes the picture.</td>', 'I had grown a bit weary of flowers, but this is a nice shot. Great choice for background color with burned edges. I don''t know if the glow is lighting or editing, but it makes the picture.', '2013-11-20 17:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132781, 1092379, 22384, '<td valign="top">This great image deserves a better title. I love it. I can almost taste the salt on the peanuts, and I love the shadows. Beautiful shapes and curves!</td>', 'This great image deserves a better title. I love it. I can almost taste the salt on the peanuts, and I love the shadows. Beautiful shapes and curves!', '2013-11-20 17:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132782, 1092408, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of lighting. I love the dark feel of this image. As an English teacher, I am not so fond of the title. ;)</td>', 'Interesting use of lighting. I love the dark feel of this image. As an English teacher, I am not so fond of the title. ;)', '2013-11-20 17:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132785, 1092431, 22384, '<td valign="top">This reminds be of Hitchcock''s Rear Window with a twist toward the kinder side of life. Fun idea. There is a wonderful, enchanted feeling to this image. Very festive!</td>', 'This reminds be of Hitchcock''s Rear Window with a twist toward the kinder side of life. Fun idea. There is a wonderful, enchanted feeling to this image. Very festive!', '2013-11-20 17:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132786, 1091997, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love this. Great use of light, reflection, with a subtle nod to the challenge. Stark, edgy, and a menacing quality to it. Love it!</td>', 'I love this. Great use of light, reflection, with a subtle nod to the challenge. Stark, edgy, and a menacing quality to it. Love it!', '2013-11-20 17:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132807, 1092355, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The lighting is distracting for me. I do like the placement withing the frame.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The lighting is distracting for me. I do like the placement withing the frame.', '2013-11-20 17:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132809, 1092435, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot. Love the sense of movement despite the crispness of the image. Really stunning combination of color. Great capture!</td>', 'Brilliant shot. Love the sense of movement despite the crispness of the image. Really stunning combination of color. Great capture!', '2013-11-20 17:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132810, 1092314, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the lines, color, shapes and placement across the frame. Well done!</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the lines, color, shapes and placement across the frame. Well done!', '2013-11-20 17:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132812, 1092294, 22384, '<td valign="top">Perfect muted color, sepia, but not quite. The muted lighting also works well. Nice choice of background.</td>', 'Perfect muted color, sepia, but not quite. The muted lighting also works well. Nice choice of background.', '2013-11-20 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132813, 1092500, 22384, '<td valign="top">Cute idea using the shadows for the 11. There are just too many other distractions. I would have cropped out a lot of the left side, and the car on the right.</td>', 'Cute idea using the shadows for the 11. There are just too many other distractions. I would have cropped out a lot of the left side, and the car on the right.', '2013-11-20 17:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132814, 1092415, 22384, '<td valign="top">So creative. I love it. I like that the pencils are not sharpened perfectly.</td>', 'So creative. I love it. I like that the pencils are not sharpened perfectly.', '2013-11-20 17:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132815, 1092260, 22384, '<td valign="top">Makes me hungry. Wish I had one of those yummy looking cupcakes. Nice touch leaving the open space without powdered sugar. Fun!</td>', 'Makes me hungry. Wish I had one of those yummy looking cupcakes. Nice touch leaving the open space without powdered sugar. Fun!', '2013-11-20 17:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132841, 1091534, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautifully evocative. My top pick.</td>', 'Beautifully evocative. My top pick.', '2013-11-20 19:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133082, 1092336, 74562, '<td valign="top">Well done, colours and style</td>', 'Well done, colours and style', '2013-11-21 04:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
