(7133230, 1092511, 22384, '<td valign="top">Love the title, but the image fell flat for me. I was looking for some kind of movement or focal point, or even moving part of the image out of the frame. Dead center and staying comfortably within the frame didn''t evoke an emotional or artistic response from me.</td>', 'Love the title, but the image fell flat for me. I was looking for some kind of movement or focal point, or even moving part of the image out of the frame. Dead center and staying comfortably within the frame didn''t evoke an emotional or artistic response from me.', '2013-11-21 12:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133231, 1092403, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stellar image and excellent choice of background pieces. I love the dripping syrup. Wonderful array of textures and the lighting works well for me! Nicely done.</td>', 'Stellar image and excellent choice of background pieces. I love the dripping syrup. Wonderful array of textures and the lighting works well for me! Nicely done.', '2013-11-21 12:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133233, 1092429, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea, but a few of the edges are soft. I want this image to be crisp and hard. The feeling of being stared at by the lenses is fun and a tad eerie.</td>', 'Brilliant idea, but a few of the edges are soft. I want this image to be crisp and hard. The feeling of being stared at by the lenses is fun and a tad eerie.', '2013-11-21 12:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133235, 1092488, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! Fun idea for this challenge and nice use of framing. Soft focus #12 works for me! Bumping up my score for creativity. This made me smile.</td>', 'I love this shot! Fun idea for this challenge and nice use of framing. Soft focus #12 works for me! Bumping up my score for creativity. This made me smile.', '2013-11-21 12:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133236, 1092475, 22384, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my college days: broke and searching for change...also was an art major for a while so, there you go...</td>', 'Reminds me of my college days: broke and searching for change...also was an art major for a while so, there you go...', '2013-11-21 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133237, 1092411, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great title. I love so much about this: the angle, the motif of shapes, the sense of things being not quite in balance. I would have like to see an even more extreme use of the value scale. Nice shot!</td>', 'Great title. I love so much about this: the angle, the motif of shapes, the sense of things being not quite in balance. I would have like to see an even more extreme use of the value scale. Nice shot!', '2013-11-21 12:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
