(7133243, 1092409, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I would like to see a bit more of the glass and no shadow of the glass since this is advanced editing. Excellent use of placement withing the frame and a sense of tipping... nice.</td>', 'Great idea! I would like to see a bit more of the glass and no shadow of the glass since this is advanced editing. Excellent use of placement withing the frame and a sense of tipping... nice.', '2013-11-21 12:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
