(7133246, 1092300, 22384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. And, yes, I am jealous of your lenses... Excellent use of the value scale, and I love the lighting. I see a wonderful juxtaposition of soft lighting and crisp lines</td>', 'Beautiful shot. And, yes, I am jealous of your lenses... Excellent use of the value scale, and I love the lighting. I see a wonderful juxtaposition of soft lighting and crisp lines', '2013-11-21 12:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133247, 1092406, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Snow is tough to shoot, and you use it to make the viewer feel the cold. Excellent sense of movement with a bit of chaos, and the look on that male''s face: something''s going down.</td>', 'Great capture. Snow is tough to shoot, and you use it to make the viewer feel the cold. Excellent sense of movement with a bit of chaos, and the look on that male''s face: something''s going down.', '2013-11-21 12:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133248, 1092492, 22384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Love the lighting and the softness of the pears in the background (voyeurs), and the great angle of the the pears checking out the "crime scene." What I love about it is that I didn''t need the title to get it. Stellar work with a great sense of fun! 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Love the lighting and the softness of the pears in the background (voyeurs), and the great angle of the the pears checking out the "crime scene." What I love about it is that I didn''t need the title to get it. Stellar work with a great sense of fun! 10', '2013-11-21 12:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133249, 1092467, 22384, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. I can see this in a child''s room, or a classroom. Nicely done!</td>', 'Pretty shot. I can see this in a child''s room, or a classroom. Nicely done!', '2013-11-21 12:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133250, 1092357, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject! I would like to see all the quills crisp. Some look a tad soft. I do like the counter-movement of the one feather. It adds interest to the shot. I might even make that more of a focal point.</td>', 'Interesting subject! I would like to see all the quills crisp. Some look a tad soft. I do like the counter-movement of the one feather. It adds interest to the shot. I might even make that more of a focal point.', '2013-11-21 12:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133251, 1092520, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too dark for me. A lot of the image gets lost. I would lighten it a bit and up the contrast to make that 11 pop even more.</td>', 'This is a bit too dark for me. A lot of the image gets lost. I would lighten it a bit and up the contrast to make that 11 pop even more.', '2013-11-21 12:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133253, 1092376, 22384, '<td valign="top">Call me OCD, but I want to straighten those spoons and iron the table cloth. Nice reflections and a pretty softness to the spoons.</td>', 'Call me OCD, but I want to straighten those spoons and iron the table cloth. Nice reflections and a pretty softness to the spoons.', '2013-11-21 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133257, 1092416, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fun idea! I would clean up the fuzz on the shoes and get rid of the label/size on the right instep. It is advanced editing, so I would take the time to clean up the image. I love the reflection on the floor. I bumping up your score just for that.</td>', 'Fun idea! I would clean up the fuzz on the shoes and get rid of the label/size on the right instep. It is advanced editing, so I would take the time to clean up the image. I love the reflection on the floor. I bumping up your score just for that.', '2013-11-21 12:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
