(7134327, 1092435, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hahja! The "yacht" is a Finn Dinghy. It used to be the single-handed class for the Olympic games, and I raced one seriously for years. It''s a beast of a boat, a real physical workout. The sail, I can tell by the logo in the corner, is by North Sails, and that''s the sail;maker I worked for when I was young :-) So thanks for the trip down memory lane...</td>', 'Hahja! The "yacht" is a Finn Dinghy. It used to be the single-handed class for the Olympic games, and I raced one seriously for years. It''s a beast of a boat, a real physical workout. The sail, I can tell by the logo in the corner, is by North Sails, and that''s the sail;maker I worked for when I was young :-) So thanks for the trip down memory lane...', '2013-11-24 17:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
