(7134442, 1091534, 124815, '<td valign="top">I wish my monitor would help me more with the dark images (I''ll fix it soon, I promise!). I bet that there are things in the dark that I''m missing and probably I am not the only one having this problem. Since I like this mystery and the bit of the flowery fabric barely visible (I guess a woman and a lovely memory) I bump this.</td>', 'I wish my monitor would help me more with the dark images (I''ll fix it soon, I promise!). I bet that there are things in the dark that I''m missing and probably I am not the only one having this problem. Since I like this mystery and the bit of the flowery fabric barely visible (I guess a woman and a lovely memory) I bump this.', '2013-11-24 22:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
