(7134965, 1092351, 30364, '<td valign="top">I saw this as a sectional thing; a big geological vertical slice of earth crust.  The geologists are on the surface.  The giant green fish reposing down at the 200-foot level is going to frighten the crap out of those geologists when their drill bit starts bringing up humongous green scales.  Could be a dragon of course, especially if they are, as seems very likely, Welsh geologists.  Oh, Boyo!<br/> <br/>P.S.  Thank you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-26 01:11:09.</i></td>', 'I saw this as a sectional thing; a big geological vertical slice of earth crust.  The geologists are on the surface.  The giant green fish reposing down at the 200-foot level is going to frighten the crap out of those geologists when their drill bit starts bringing up humongous green scales.  Could be a dragon of course, especially if they are, as seems very likely, Welsh geologists.  Oh, Boyo! P.S.  Thank you.', '2013-11-26 01:07:02.000000', '2013-11-26 01:11:09.000000', 0),
